  "details": "Scenario A:\n\n1. Open worlds list\n\n2. Navigate to desired world\n\n3. Group+ instance is not listed (but this would list invite-only and friends-only instances if there were any, this behavior is therefore inconsistent with scenario B)\n\nScenario B:\n\n1. Open groups list\n\n2. Navigate to group\n\n3. Navigate to instances list of group\n\n4. Click on instance\n\n5. Group+ instance is listed and pre-selected\n\nThe in-app UI queries the list of instances through the `worlds/<id>` API endpoint which appears to not return Group+ instances regardless of the viewer being a member of the group or having a friend in the instance.",
